# Used by `npm run dev:tv` (vite --mode tv). Vite auto-loads this file for
# that mode -- see src/modules/native/platform-info.ts's own comment, which
# already referenced this file before it actually existed.
#
# Forces isTVPlatform (see platform-info.ts) to true without needing a real
# Android TV device or emulator, or the native PlatformInfo plugin at all --
# useful for iterating on TV-only UI (modules/device-profiles/, the D-pad
# navigation in modules/cinema/dpad-nav.ts) from a regular desktop browser.
#
# Does NOT affect cinemaMode (useApp.ts) -- that's a separate, always-
# user-toggleable setting (see the Cinema button in Settings) and doesn't
# need a dev override; its own UA-sniffing default guess is unrelated to
# this flag by design (see platform-info.ts's comment on isTVPlatform for
# why the two are intentionally kept separate).
VITE_FORCE_TV=true
